; fault.mant -- jumping into data stops the machine.
;
; An instruction is a number, and so is data, so nothing keeps a jump out of
; a table.  The number 1000 is not an instruction, though: its opcode digits
; are 00.  The machine stops and says so.
        LDI.F  f0, table
        JMP    f0
        HALT                   ; never reached
table:  DATA.D 1000
